msgid "Customize the transpiler passes run during each stage.\n"
msgstr "Sesuaikan laluan transpiler yang dijalankan semasa setiap peringkat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the product formula that Trotterizes an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate in fermionic space, either per gate or for a whole pipeline with [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") (see [Synthesize an Evolution gate in fermionic space](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation)).\n"
msgstr "Pilih formula hasil darab yang mentrotterisasi get [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") dalam ruang fermionik, sama ada bagi setiap get atau bagi keseluruhan saluran paip dengan [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") (lihat [Sintesis get Evolution dalam ruang fermionik](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation)).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implement custom fermion-to-qubit mappings by creating synthesis plugins (see [`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\")).\n"
msgstr "Laksanakan pemetaan fermion-ke-qubit tersuai dengan mencipta pemalam sintesis (lihat [`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\")).\n"

